52    write(22, "{\"parentUuid\":\"3dca6623-6f6e-4f01-9a4d-84c2dd941bbc\",\"isSidechain\":false,\"promptId\":\"c7cea389-7145-4409-9b18-17c65d2e45c5\",\"type\":\"user\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_01BfVGy65ZmXBogqUJL5JUUQ\",\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"content\":\"1\\t---\\n2\\tname: design-lab\\n3\\tdescription: Conduct design interviews, generate five distinct UI variations in a temporary design lab, collect feedback, and produce implementation plans. Use when the user wants to explore UI design options, redesign existing components, or create new UI with multiple approaches to compare.\\n4\\t---\\n5\\t\\n6\\t# Design Lab Skill\\n7\\t\\n8\\tThis skill implements a complete design exploration workflow: interview, generate variations, collect feedback, refine, preview, and finalize.\\n9\\t\\n10\\t## CRITICAL: Cleanup Behavior\\n11\\t\\n12\\t**All temporary files MUST be deleted when the process ends, whether by:**\\n13\\t- User confirms final design \342\206\222 cleanup, then generate plan\\n14\\t- User aborts/cancels \342\206\222 cleanup immediately, no plan generated\\n15\\t\\n16\\t**Never leave `.claude-design/` or `__design_lab` routes behind.** If the user says \\\"cancel\\\", \\\"abort\\\", \\\"stop\\\", or \\\"nevermind\\\" at any point, confirm and then delete all temporary artifacts.\\n17\\t\\n18\\t---\\n19\\t\\n20\\t## Phase 0: Preflight Detection\\n21\\t\\n22\\tBefore starting the interview, automatically detect:\\n23\\t\\n24\\t### Package Manager\\n25\\tCheck for lock files in the project root:\\n26\\t- `pnpm-lock.yaml` \342\206\222 use `pnpm`\\n27\\t- `yarn.lock` \342\206\222 use `yarn`\\n28\\t- `package-lock.json` \342\206\222 use `npm`\\n29\\t- `bun.lockb` \342\206\222 use `bun`\\n30\\t\\n31\\t### Framework Detection\\n32\\tCheck for config files:\\n33\\t- `next.config.js` or `next.config.mjs` or `next.config.ts` \342\206\222 **Next.js**\\n34\\t  - Check for `app/` directory \342\206\222 App Router\\n35\\t  - Check for `pages/` directory \342\206\222 Pages Router\\n36\\t- `vite.config.js` or `vite.config.ts` \342\206\222 **Vite**\\n37\\t- `remix.config.js` \342\206\222 **Remix**\\n38\\t- `nuxt.config.js` or `nuxt.config.ts` \342\206\222 **Nuxt**\\n39\\t- `astr"..., 68189) = 68189
